{"id": 43791790, "slug": "bitcoin-is-not-money-why-bitcoin", "title": "Bitcoin Is Not Money - Why Bitcoin is Cool (p1)", "subtitle": "April 29th, 2016", "post_date": "2021-11-09T19:11:27.908Z", "audience": "everyone", "wordcount": 777, "reaction_count": 0, "comment_count": 0, "restacks": 0, "reactions": {"\u2764": 0}, "body_html": "<p><em>This is the first in our series of posts on bitcoin.</em></p><p><em>While we hold no material position in bitcoin, we have been studying this market for some time.&nbsp;.</em></p><p><em>Our overarching conclusion on bitcoin is simple:</em></p><blockquote><p><em>Bitcoin can be cool, or bitcoin can be money, but it cannot be both.</em></p></blockquote><p><em>The structure of this series follows this line of thinking</em></p><p><strong>Part 1: Bitcoin the Ideology\u200a</strong>\u2014\u200aWhy bitcoin is cool</p><p><strong>Part 2: Bitcoin the Currency</strong>\u200a\u2014\u200aWhy bitcoin isn\u2019t money</p><p><strong>Part 3: Ideology vs Currency </strong>\u2014Why the scale question is existential</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rFY1!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F86175aa8-515c-4482-85c6-41a1f39283b7_750x416.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rFY1!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F86175aa8-515c-4482-85c6-41a1f39283b7_750x416.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rFY1!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F86175aa8-515c-4482-85c6-41a1f39283b7_750x416.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rFY1!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F86175aa8-515c-4482-85c6-41a1f39283b7_750x416.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rFY1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F86175aa8-515c-4482-85c6-41a1f39283b7_750x416.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rFY1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F86175aa8-515c-4482-85c6-41a1f39283b7_750x416.jpeg\" width=\"750\" height=\"416\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/86175aa8-515c-4482-85c6-41a1f39283b7_750x416.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:416,&quot;width&quot;:750,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rFY1!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F86175aa8-515c-4482-85c6-41a1f39283b7_750x416.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rFY1!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F86175aa8-515c-4482-85c6-41a1f39283b7_750x416.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rFY1!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F86175aa8-515c-4482-85c6-41a1f39283b7_750x416.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rFY1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F86175aa8-515c-4482-85c6-41a1f39283b7_750x416.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h3><em>PART 1: BITCOIN THE IDEOLOGY</em></h3><p>When Satoshi banged out his <a href=\"https://bitcoin.org/bitcoin.pdf\">white paper</a> introducing bitcoin back in 2008, he saw some very real problems at the heart of our modern notions of money.</p><p>See, pretty much all of the money in the world is held in banks and backed by governments.</p><p>This can lead to problems when, as they are wont to do, banks fail, and governments print too much money.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YW0Q!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F44fa3e89-1aff-4224-81ab-d05b3f03ba94_750x238.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YW0Q!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F44fa3e89-1aff-4224-81ab-d05b3f03ba94_750x238.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YW0Q!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F44fa3e89-1aff-4224-81ab-d05b3f03ba94_750x238.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YW0Q!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F44fa3e89-1aff-4224-81ab-d05b3f03ba94_750x238.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YW0Q!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimag